  - m_Id: 42017882112
    m_Localized: You spot a chest hidden in the middle of the forest. What can it
      contain?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 616092270592
    m_Localized: You stumble upon a magic well. Perhaps you should exchange something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1025624113152
    m_Localized: A merchant is waving at you. It seems he has something to sell !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2027735613440
    m_Localized: In the middle of the forest, you come across a campfire. Nobody
      seems to be nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2833209753600
    m_Localized: "This frog has a head you don\u2019t remember. Should you kick his
      ass?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3172851908608
    m_Localized: "But it\u2019s the legendary Pepe ! He seems so happy in the forest
      ! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
